       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TMKRQUE.
      *================================================================*
      * UNIT TESTS FOR MKRQUEUE (MAKER-CHECKER QUEUE)                  *
      *================================================================*
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           COPY MKRPARM.
           COPY UTWS.
       01  WS-TODAY                    PIC 9(08).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MOVE 'MKRQUEUE' TO UT-SUITE
           ACCEPT WS-TODAY FROM DATE YYYYMMDD

           MOVE 'FIRST ITEM GETS REFERENCE 1' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 1000-ADD
           MOVE 1 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE MKR-ID TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'SECOND ITEM GETS REFERENCE 2' TO UT-NAME
           PERFORM 1000-ADD
           MOVE 2 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE MKR-ID TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'COUNT SEES TWO PENDING' TO UT-NAME
           INITIALIZE MKR-PARMS
           SET MKR-COUNT TO TRUE
           CALL 'MKRQUEUE' USING MKR-PARMS
           MOVE 2 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE MKR-PENDING TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'EXPIRE WITH TODAY KEEPS TODAY''S ITEMS' TO UT-NAME
           INITIALIZE MKR-PARMS
           SET MKR-EXPIRE TO TRUE
           MOVE WS-TODAY TO MKR-RUN-DATE
           CALL 'MKRQUEUE' USING MKR-PARMS
           MOVE 0 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE MKR-PENDING TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'EXPIRE WITH A LATER DATE EXPIRES BOTH' TO UT-NAME
           INITIALIZE MKR-PARMS
           SET MKR-EXPIRE TO TRUE
           MOVE 29991231 TO MKR-RUN-DATE
           CALL 'MKRQUEUE' USING MKR-PARMS
           MOVE 2 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE MKR-PENDING TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           MOVE 'NOTHING PENDING AFTER EXPIRY' TO UT-NAME
           INITIALIZE MKR-PARMS
           SET MKR-COUNT TO TRUE
           CALL 'MKRQUEUE' USING MKR-PARMS
           MOVE 0 TO UT-EXPECTED-NUM
           MOVE MKR-PENDING TO UT-ACTUAL-NUM
           PERFORM UT-ASSERT-NUM

           PERFORM UT-FINISH
           STOP RUN.

       1000-ADD.
           INITIALIZE MKR-PARMS
           SET MKR-ADD TO TRUE
           MOVE 'T' TO MKR-TYPE
           MOVE 1000000001 TO MKR-FROM-ACCT
           MOVE 1000000002 TO MKR-TO-ACCT
           MOVE 250000 TO MKR-AMOUNT
           MOVE 'UNIT TEST' TO MKR-NARRATION
           CALL 'MKRQUEUE' USING MKR-PARMS.

           COPY UTPROC.
